        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Here’s a clear and professional version you can send to the district manager:  \n\n---\n\n**Subject:** Urgent Clarification Needed Regarding Invoice and Communication Issues  \n\nDear [District Manager’s Name],  \n\nI spoke with the office lawyers yesterday, and they confirmed the payment amount. However, another invoice was suddenly added afterward. I also reached out to the property management, but the manager has not responded to my email or acknowledged my concerns. The new invoice appears vague, and I only received communication about it yesterday, despite my first letter being issued on July 29. I have been trying to cooperate and make payment, but the amount now differs from what was confirmed. It feels like the process is being handled unfairly, and I would like to know where I can raise my concerns formally. Please help clarify this matter so I can proceed with payment today as agreed.  \n\nSincerely,  \nAmit Puri  \n\n---\n\nWould you like me to make it a little **firmer but still respectful** (e.g., suitable for escalation to the law society or head office)?"
          ]
        },
